# One K1 played from the keyboard with the mjlab skill policies (receive, dribble, kick), run inside the sim.
# No NUbots process and no DDS: module::SkillPlayer reads the sim state, runs the policy and sends the servo targets
# to Locomotion itself. Supervisor is here only to place the ball (it stays off the GameController by default).
k1sim_role(
  ConsoleLog
  Simulation
  Locomotion
  Supervisor
  SkillPlayer
  Viewer
  WebViewer
)
